<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Aug 28 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Aug 28 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ended August 21</p>
<p>U.S. business Loans.......360,536 up.....2,399</p>
<p>Excluding acceptances.....358,964 up.....2,397</p>
